"* ``report.formula.column`` and ``report.formula.external.value``\n"
"* ``report.formula.custom.handler`` -- the abstract model a report's custom\n"
"  handler inherits\n"
"\n"
"The models were ``account.report*`` while ``account`` owned them, before this\n"
