"  over to a new bucket\n"
"* the device's MQTT session is its ``integration.stream``: the stream worker\n"
"  dials AWS IoT Core with the device's client certificate and the profile's\n"
"  root authority (``remote``), and ``_on_stream_frame`` hands each counter\n"
"  payload to the aggregator instead of the raw ``device.data.log``\n"
