#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_stock
msgid ""
"\n"
"Stock & Asset Approvals\n"
"=======================\n"
"\n"
"Approval workflow on ``stock.picking`` through ``mixin.approval``, plus asset\n"
"fields on the request.\n"
"\n"
"Approval triggers, configured per approval category:\n"
"\n"
"* source or destination location in ``location_ids``\n"
"* operation types in ``picking_type_ids``\n"
"* product categories in ``stock_product_categ_ids``\n"
"\n"
"``stock_approval_mode`` only chooses which trigger fields the category form\n"
"shows — every non-empty criterion above constrains matching regardless of it.\n"
"Who approves, and in what order, is the category's steps.\n"
"``stock_auto_validate_on_approval`` validates the transfer once approved.\n"
"\n"
"Requests carry ``asset_id`` and ``odometer`` (``has_asset`` /\n"
"``has_odometer`` on the category) and write an asset log on approval.\n"
"\n"
"Two directions are supported: request approval for an existing picking, or\n"
"create the picking from an approved request.\n"
"\n"
"Inventory adjustments: ``stock.inventory.adjustment`` holds a snapshot of\n"
"counted quants (counted and on-hand quantity per quant) and is approved or\n"
"refused whole, through categories of type ``stock_inventory`` matched on the\n"
"same ``location_ids`` and ``stock_product_categ_ids``. Approval applies the\n"
"counts at the counting date; a quant whose on-hand quantity moved since the\n"
"request cancels the adjustment and leaves every count in place for a recount.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_scale_delivery
msgid ""
"\n"
"Stock Scale Delivery\n"
"====================\n"
"\n"
"The Delivery Slip \"Total Weight\" is bound to ``shipping_weight``, the\n"
"theoretical catalog weight (sum of qty x ``product.weight``), so products with\n"
"weight 0 vanish from the printed total. This bridge prints the gross weight\n"
"actually measured at the scale whenever received weighings (``stock.scale``)\n"
"exist, and falls back to ``shipping_weight`` for non-weighing pickings.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document
msgid ""
"\n"
"Store, organize and share files: a folder tree with per-document access rights,\n"
"share links, versioning, a trash and the Documents workspace, with the sharing,\n"
"operation and link-to-record wizards, the onboarding tour, the digest KPIs and\n"
"the Studio automation upsell.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_studio
msgid ""
"\n"
"Studio - Customize Odoo\n"
"=======================\n"
"\n"
"This addon allows the user to customize most element of the user interface, "
"in a\n"
"simple and graphical way. It has two main features:\n"
"\n"
"* create a new application (add module, top level menu item, and default "
"action)\n"
"* customize an existing application (edit menus, actions, views, "
"translations, ...)\n"
"\n"
"Note: Only the admin user is allowed to make those customizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Studio - Odoon räätälöiminen\n"
"=======================\n"
"\n"
"Tämä lisäosa antaa käyttäjälle mahdollisuuden räätälöidä useimmat "
"käyttöliittymän elementit,\n"
"yksinkertaisella ja graafisella tavalla. Sillä on kaksi pääominaisuutta:\n"
"\n"
"* uuden sovelluksen luominen (moduulin, ylimmän tason valikkokohdan ja "
"oletustoiminnon lisääminen)\n"
"* muokata olemassa olevaa sovellusta (muokata valikoita, toimintoja, "
"näkymiä, käännöksiä, ...)\n"
"\n"
"Huomautus: Vain käyttäjä, jolla on ylläpitäjän valtuudet, voi tehdä näitä "
"mukautuksia.\n"

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_studio
