"testien\n"
"suorittamiseen, jotka koskevat muiden mallien toiminnallisia näkökohtia. "

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_test_automation
msgid ""
"This module contains tests related to base automation. Those are\n"
"present in a separate module as it contains models used only to perform\n"
"tests independently to functional aspects of other models.\n"
"\n"
"This module includes:\n"
"- Test models for automation testing (leads, projects)\n"
"- Comprehensive test suites (109+ integration tests)\n"
"- Demo automations showcasing various trigger types and patterns\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_test_import_export
